=about vash

vash (c) 1990-1993,1996,2018-2022 vsv

Vash is visual assistant for shell.
Vash covers command string but not hides if from user.
Please, refer to 'man vash' to get full description.

Context-depended help pages is accesible on-line pressing key .:HE... 
Pressing .:HE... again shows help page about common library keys.
Pressing any other key will return from help page.

Vash can be tuned on-line via setup page on key .'9 which has own help page.

Visual representation of dialogues and keyboard assignments may be changed
on Your taste with 'vhset' command, using VHSET and TERM environment.
Please, refer to on-line help pages of 'vhset' and to 'man vhset' for details.



